";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:36:"http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace";a:1:{s:4:"lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:1:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:5:{s:2:"id";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:65:"tag:github.com,2008:https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:4:"link";a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:9:"text/html";s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"href";s:45:"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:20:"application/atom+xml";s:3:"rel";s:4:"self";s:4:"href";s:50:"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases.atom";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:27:"Release notes from FreshRSS";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"updated";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:20:"2026-10-21T20:33:48Z";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:5:"entry";a:10:{i:0;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:38:"
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  ";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:2:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:6:{s:2:"id";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:45:"tag:github.com,2008:Repository/6322699/1.30.4";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"updated";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:20:"2026-10-21T20:45:47Z";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"type";s:9:"text/html";s:4:"href";s:56:"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.4";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:15:"FreshRSS 1.30.4";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"content";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:2307:"<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/milestones/1.30.4">Milestone</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This is a fourth security release in the continuation of <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.3">1.30.x</a>, mostly to address some severe PHP vulnerabilities and update our official alternative Docker images (Alpine) (our default Docker images based on Debian were already fixed).</p>
<p>Note that our rolling-release channel (<em>edge</em>) is recommended for faster security patches.</p>
<p>Bug fixes highlights 🐛:</p>
<ul>
<li>PHP CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619 <a href="https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-21-5" rel="nofollow">php#2026-10-21-5</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This release has been made by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Alkarex/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Alkarex">@Alkarex</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Frenzie/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Frenzie">@Frenzie</a> and newcomer <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/icco/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/icco">@icco</a></p>
<p>Full <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/blob/1.30.4/CHANGELOG.md">changelog</a>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Security
<ul>
<li>Docker alternative image (Alpine 3.24) updated with PHP 8.5.12 and Apache 2.4.69 <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/issues/9475" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/issues/9475/hovercard">#9475</a></li>
<li>Docker: disable PHP <code>session.upload_progress.enabled</code> for additional security <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9476" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9476/hovercard">#9476</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>I18n
<ul>
<li>Improve Dutch <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9479" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9479/hovercard">#9479</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:4:"type";s:4:"html";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:6:"author";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:12:"
      
    ";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:1:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:1:{s:4:"name";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:7:"Alkarex";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}}}}}}s:29:"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/";a:1:{s:9:"thumbnail";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:6:"height";s:2:"30";s:5:"width";s:2:"30";s:3:"url";s:56:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1008324?s=60&v=4";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:38:"
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  ";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:2:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:6:{s:2:"id";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:45:"tag:github.com,2008:Repository/6322699/1.30.3";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"updated";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:20:"2026-10-21T14:30:01Z";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"type";s:9:"text/html";s:4:"href";s:56:"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.3";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:15:"FreshRSS 1.30.3";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"content";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:2462:"<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/milestones/1.30.3">Milestone</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This is a third security release in the continuation of <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.2">1.30.x</a>, mostly to address some severe PHP vulnerabilities and update our official default Docker images (Debian) (but not our alternative Alpine images yet, which are delayed).</p>
<p>Note that our rolling-release channel (<em>edge</em>) is recommended for faster security patches.</p>
<p>Bug fixes highlights 🐛:</p>
<ul>
<li>PHP CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619 <a href="https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-21-5" rel="nofollow">php#2026-10-21-5</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This release has been made by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Alkarex/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Alkarex">@Alkarex</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Inverle/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Inverle">@Inverle</a> and newcomer <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Ricardo-Simoes/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Ricardo-Simoes">@Ricardo-Simoes</a></p>
<p>Full <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/blob/1.30.3/CHANGELOG.md">changelog</a>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Deployment
<ul>
<li>Docker default image updated to Debian 13 Trixie with PHP 8.4.27-1~deb13u1 and Apache 2.4.69</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Extensions
<ul>
<li>New hook: <code>Minz_HookType::AutofillField</code> for auth views <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9362" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9362/hovercard">#9362</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>I18n
<ul>
<li>Improve Brazilian Portuguese <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9473" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9473/hovercard">#9473</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Misc.
<ul>
<li>Translate non-English code comments and identifiers <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9383" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9383/hovercard">#9383</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:4:"type";s:4:"html";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:6:"author";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:12:"
      
    ";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:1:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:1:{s:4:"name";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:7:"Alkarex";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}}}}}}s:29:"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/";a:1:{s:9:"thumbnail";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:6:"height";s:2:"30";s:5:"width";s:2:"30";s:3:"url";s:56:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1008324?s=60&v=4";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}}}}i:2;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:38:"
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  ";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";s:5:"child";a:2:{s:27:"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom";a:6:{s:2:"id";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:45:"tag:github.com,2008:Repository/6322699/1.30.2";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"updated";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:20:"2026-10-19T20:57:49Z";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:4:"link";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:0:"";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:3:{s:3:"rel";s:9:"alternate";s:4:"type";s:9:"text/html";s:4:"href";s:56:"https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.2";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:5:"title";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:15:"FreshRSS 1.30.2";s:7:"attribs";a:0:{}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:7:"content";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:"data";s:7998:"<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/milestones/1.30.2">Milestone</a></li>
</ul>
<p>This is a second security and bug-fixing release in the continuation of <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/releases/tag/1.30.1">1.30.x</a>.</p>
<p>Note that our rolling-release channel (<em>edge</em>) is recommended for faster security patches.</p>
<p>Bug fixes highlights 🐛:</p>
<ul>
<li>Fix PHP 8.5+ deprecation warning with SQLite</li>
<li>Block <code>data:</code> URI scheme in some cases</li>
</ul>
<p>Performance highlights 🏎️:</p>
<ul>
<li>Reduce memory consumption of export</li>
</ul>
<p>This release has been made by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Alkarex/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Alkarex">@Alkarex</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Inverle/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Inverle">@Inverle</a> and newcomers <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/abp002/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/abp002">@abp002</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Arslan-TR/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Arslan-TR">@Arslan-TR</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Emredinho61/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Emredinho61">@Emredinho61</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HawkForge/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HawkForge">@HawkForge</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/lordmarrik/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/lordmarrik">@lordmarrik</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/spa77k/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/spa77k">@spa77k</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/tomac4t/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/tomac4t">@tomac4t</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/tpq2030/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/tpq2030">@tpq2030</a></p>
<p>Full <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/blob/1.30.2/CHANGELOG.md">changelog</a>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Security
<ul>
<li>SimplePie sanitizer: block <code>data:</code> URI scheme while keeping <code>data:image</code> for images <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9417" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9417/hovercard">#9417</a></li>
<li>Mitigate some 404 situations <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9435" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9435/hovercard">#9435</a></li>
<li>Do not log the Fever API key on authentication failure <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9468" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9468/hovercard">#9468</a></li>
<li>Fix local DNS leak when fetching feeds through a proxy <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9451" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9451/hovercard">#9451</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Bug fixes
<ul>
<li>WebSub fix POST, fix warning, better message <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9420" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9420/hovercard">#9420</a></li>
<li>Fix PHP 8.5+ deprecation of <code>sqliteCreateFunction</code> for SQLite <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9421" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9421/hovercard">#9421</a></li>
<li>Preserve explicit sort overrides when searching <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9467" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9467/hovercard">#9467</a></li>
<li>Fix wrong order of args in extension compatibility check <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9445" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9445/hovercard">#9445</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Performance
<ul>
<li>Reduce memory consumption of export <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9350/hovercard">#9350</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Features
<ul>
<li>Better doc and log proxy cases <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9436" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9436/hovercard">#9436</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Extensions
<ul>
<li>Update registerHook docs with newer PHP 8.1+ syntax for callables <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9443" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9443/hovercard">#9443</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/Extensions/pull/548" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/Extensions/pull/548/hovercard">Extensions#548</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>UI
<ul>
<li>Disallow user page navigation while refreshing feeds <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9446" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9446/hovercard">#9446</a></li>
<li>Various UI and style improvements <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9426" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9426/hovercard">#9426</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9441" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9441/hovercard">#9441</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>I18n
<ul>
<li>Improve German <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9439" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9439/hovercard">#9439</a></li>
<li>Improve Polish <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9458" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9458/hovercard">#9458</a></li>
<li>Improve Turkish <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9440" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9440/hovercard">#9440</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Misc.
<ul>
<li>Update to <code>GT\CssXPath</code> 1.6.0 <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9411" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9411/hovercard">#9411</a></li>
<li>CI/CD: Fix login to Docker Hub <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9433" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9433/hovercard">#9433</a></li>
<li>Fix SVGO zero percent filtering in CI <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9422" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9422/hovercard">#9422</a></li>
<li>Update dev dependencies <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9425" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9425/hovercard">#9425</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>";s:7:"attribs";a:1:{s:0:"";a:1:{s:4:"type";s:4:"html";}}s:8:"xml_base";s:0:"";s:17:"xml_base_explicit";b:0;s:8:"xml_lang";s:5:"en-US";}}s:6:"author";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:4:"data";s:12:"
      
