<ul>
<li>Pluralize the <em>new articles</em> count message</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Prefer OS-bundled Japanese fonts when UI language is Japanese <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9002" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9002/hovercard">#9002</a></li>
