<li>Improve Greek <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8977" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8977/hovercard">#8977</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9038" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9038/hovercard">#9038</a></li>
<li>Improve Hungarian <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8879" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8879/hovercard">#8879</a></li>
<li>Improve Indonesian (Bahasa Indonesia) <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9220" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9220/hovercard">#9220</a></li>
<li>Improve Italian <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8880" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8880/hovercard">#8880</a></li>
<li>Improve Japanese <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9064" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9064/hovercard">#9064</a></li>
