<li>Improve PHP code <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8906" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8906/hovercard">#8906</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9156" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/9156/hovercard">#9156</a></li>
<li>Fix PHPStan 2.2.2 in CLI <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8911" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8911/hovercard">#8911</a></li>
<li>Migrate <code>markdownlint-cli</code> to <code>markdownlint-cli2</code> <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8987" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8987/hovercard">#8987</a></li>
<li>Update dev dependencies <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8904" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8904/hovercard">#8904</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8905" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8905/hovercard">#8905</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8926" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8926/hovercard">#8926</a>,<br>
