<li>Various UI and style improvements: <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8537" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8537/hovercard">#8537</a>, <a href="https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8538" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/FreshRSS/FreshRSS/pull/8538/hovercard">#8538</a>,<br>
